<title>JAPAN: Ricoh - 6mth group results(SEC).</title>
<headline>Ricoh - 6mth group results(SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		632.86		vs	  521.52</p>
<p> Operating	   34.63		vs	   24.82</p>
<p> Pretax		28.60		vs	   22.71</p>
<p> Net		   12.94		vs	    9.69</p>
<p> EPS		   17.61 yen	  vs	   13.88 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ricoh Co Ltd is a leading maker of copiers. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
